# `vercel deploy` from a laptop uploads the working tree; never let a local
# .env fill in production settings that are missing on Vercel.
.env*
# Once this file exists the CLI stops reading .gitignore, so list the rest of
# what must never be uploaded: database dumps, local tool state, test output.
backups/
supabase/.temp/
scrollcraft/
test-results/
playwright-report/
coverage/
